      <h3>2. Server log files</h3>
      <p>Each time our website is accessed, our hosting provider automatically collects the following technical information in server log files: IP address of the requesting device, date and time of access, URL accessed, data volume transferred, HTTP status code, browser and operating system used, and the referrer URL where applicable.</p>
