      <p>You can also book a consultation call via a Calendly widget. The widget is <strong>only loaded after you have explicitly clicked “Load booking calendar”</strong> — no connection to Calendly is made beforehand. The provider is <strong>Calendly LLC</strong>, 271 17th St. NW, Suite 1000, Atlanta, GA 30363, USA. By clicking, you consent to the widget loading; technical data such as your IP address and browser information — and, when booking, the data you enter (name, email, phone if given, appointment details) — are transmitted to Calendly. The legal basis for loading is Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent), for the booking Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR. Calendly LLC is certified under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework (Art. 45 GDPR). Privacy policy: <a href="https://calendly.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">calendly.com/privacy</a>.</p>

